      "updated": 1787828330669,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Jaeger\n* rekam alur perjalanan 1 request \n  spesifik lebih detail dari call\n  fastify s/d query drizzle ORM\n* e.g : \n  * waktu yg dibutuhkan untk query \n    \"select * from employees\" via\n    drizzle-orm ?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
